Not Null to Null
let suppose while making table,you add contraint of Not null which means column should not be null,now you want to convert that Not Null condition to Null which means now that column will accept null values

alter table users modify column date_of_birth date Null

Now  you want that condition back,you can again make it to Not Null from Null
alter table users modify column date_of_birth date Not Null

