Manual add constraint 
It means we can add condition on any column that he has to first fullfill our criteria before adding data

Example 1:
We only want those people in db who born after independence day
alter table users add constraint check-date  check(date_of_birth>"1947-01-01");

Now on below query,it will not accept dob is on 1900
insert into users (name,email,gender,date_of_birth,salary) values ("kessa","tay2112@gmail.com","Male","1900-09-09",20000);

Example 2:
We only want those people in db whose salary greater than 19000
alter table users add constraint check_salary  check(salary>19000);
Now not acceptable below command
insert into users (name,email,gender,date_of_birth,salary) values ("kessa","tay2112@gmail.com","Male","1990-09-09",2000);


